  stageId: college
  stageTitle: College
  introLine: College, and the city is full of people who need you. The disaster is
    close now. Help everyone you can.
  completeLine: You're ready. Whatever comes next, everything you've learned will
    decide your future.
  nightDreams:
  - You dream of the city at night. The lights flicker, then go out, one street at
    a time.
  - '"It''s almost time," the shadowy figure whispers. "Everything you''ve learned
    will matter."'
  - You dream of the port. The water is still. Too still.
